# Two-page monthly newsletter of a few villages, with a newspaper look: front-page masthead,
# main story with a cropped photo (Fit: fill), three-column articles with a rule and
# balanced breaks, text with a photo beside it, a calendar in a table and classified ads in
# a grid. The body is Markdown inside Columns. The front-page masthead is a block of the
# first page; the following ones carry a fixed running head (Pages: not-first). The labels are written in
# lowercase and put in uppercase with Case, sometimes with letter spacing (Letter spacing).
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
